          <div class="large-12 columns">
            <div class="panel radius">
              <div>
                <h2 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.75em;">Welcome to MedCyprus</h2>
                <p>MedCyprus is a digital corpus of the Greek painted inscriptions of medieval Cyprus, bringing together inscriptions preserved in the murals of churches from the tenth to the thirteenth century. Through searchable editions, translations, images, and contextual information, the project makes this rich body of epigraphic material accessible for the study of the epigraphy, history, language, art, and culture of medieval Cyprus.</p>
                  
                 <p> MedCyprus is a dynamic and evolving resource. We welcome your comments, corrections, and suggestions as we continue to develop and enrich the corpus. </p>
              </div>

              
            </div>
